---
name: pdf-extract
description: Extracts text and tables from PDF files. Use when the user wants to read a PDF, pull tables out of a PDF, or convert a PDF to text.
---

# PDF extract

1. Open the PDF with `pdfplumber`.
2. For each page, extract text with `page.extract_text()` and tables with `page.extract_tables()`.
3. Return the text in reading order and each table as Markdown.
